== Trivia ==
* This item is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse#White Horse|White Horse]], one of the ''Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse'' described in the last book of the Bible. This is reinforced by the fact that the item is dropped by {{E|Conquest}}, which is a further reference to that passage of Christian theology.
* The item appears to be a stick horse.

